GeneralsX: FSR 2 inputs from the D3D9 device. The game passes its camera
through the exported GeneralsX_UpscalerSubmitFrame and sets render state
252 after its 3D scene; the device copies colour and depth there and the
swap chain hands them to the blitter with the next present.

